gametitle=Gran Turismo 4 Online - Papao Spec analog distance v0.3 (SCUS-97436, 646B2E29)

[Camera/Analog distance and pitch]
description=Cardinal right stick: distance and pitch; center and diagonals ignored. Release holds. Port-2 R3 (C): exact per-car factory camera. Original FOV. Use one camera mod.
// Standalone PNACH. Start from a fresh game boot; do not combine camera mods.
